                                    •
                                </p>
                            </td>
                            <td colspan="9">
                                <p class="s38"
                                    style="padding-top: 5pt;padding-left: 5pt;margin-left: 5pt;font-size: 11pt;text-align: justify;">
                                    <b>Eligibility</b> - If you were automatically covered by FERS, or you elected to
                                    transfer from CSRS, you will participate in the Basic Benefit plan. To be vested and
                                    receive retirement benefits from this plan you must have at least 5 years of
                                    creditable civilian service. Survivor and disability benefits are available after 18
                                    months of service.
                                </p>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="1">
                                <p class="s38"
                                    style="padding-top: 5pt;padding-left: 5pt;margin-left: 5pt;font-size: 11pt;text-align: justify;color: #2E5395;">
                                    •
                                </p>
                            </td>
                            <td colspan="9">
                                <p class="s38"
                                    style="padding-top: 5pt;padding-left: 5pt;margin-left: 5pt;font-size: 11pt;text-align: justify;">
                                    <b>Contributions by employees to FERS:</b>
                                </p>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="1">
                                <p style="text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;">
                                </p>
                            </td>
                            <td colspan="9">
                                <p class="s38"
                                    style="padding-top: 5pt;padding-left: 2pt;margin-left: 5pt;font-size: 11pt;text-align: justify;color: #2E5395;">
                                    •
                                    <span style="padding-left: 5pt;color:black;">
                                        FERS – Hired on/after 1/1/1987 – Code K – Contribution 0.8%
                                    </span>
                                </p>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="1">
                                <p style="text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;">
                                </p>
                            </td>
                            <td colspan="9">
                                <p class="s38"
                                    style="padding-top: 5pt;padding-left: 2pt;margin-left: 5pt;font-size: 11pt;text-align: justify;color: #2E5395;">
                                    •
                                    <span style="padding-left: 5pt;color:black;">
                                        FERS-RAE – Hired on/after 1/1/2013 – Code KR – Contribution 3.1%
                                    </span>
                                </p>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="1">
                                <p style="text-indent: 0pt;text-align: left;">
                                </p>
                            </td>
                            <td colspan="9">
                                <p class="s38"
