                        <table style="width: 78%" align="center" cellspacing="0">
                            <tbody>
                                <tr>
                                    <td colspan="100%">
                                        <p class="s38" style="font-size: 11pt;text-align: justify;">Retiring federal
                                            employees under both the CSRS and FERS retirement systems have the
                                            opportunity to ensure the continuation of <a
                                                name="spouseannuitylink">benefits to survivors</a> with an insurable
                                            interest. A person with an insurable interest is an insurance term, applying
                                            to a person who would benefit financially by your continuing to be alive.
                                            Such persons would include, but are not limited to a widow, widower, former
                                            spouse, and children.
                                        </p><br />
                                        <p class="s38"
                                            style="margin-left: 5pt;padding-top: 5pt;font-size: 11pt;text-align: justify;color: red;">
                                            •
                                            <span style="padding-left: 5pt;color: black;">
                                                May elect a Survivor Benefit of either 25% or 50% or their retirement
                                                annuity
                                            </span>
                                        </p>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td colspan="100%">
                                        <p class="s38"
                                            style="margin-left: 5pt;padding-top: 5pt;font-size: 11pt;text-align: justify;color: red;">
                                            •
                                            <span style="padding-left: 5pt;color: black;">
                                                If 25% is elected, their annuity will be reduced by 5%
                                            </span>
                                        </p>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td colspan="100%">
                                        <p class="s38"
