                                            </span>
                                        </p>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td colspan="100%">
                                        <p class="s38" style="font-size: 11pt;text-align: justify;">
                                            To provide a survivor annuity for a person who has an "insurable interest"
                                            in you, your annual annuity would be reduced from 10 - 40%, depending on the
                                            difference in your age and the age of the person named.
                                        </p>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td colspan="100%">
                                        <p class="s38" style="font-size: 11pt;text-align: justify;">
